; Wrap pause counter (byte)
;
; Set to 90 (WRAP_PAUSE) by #R$6337 when Horace walks onto a wrap pad at the top or bottom of the maze and is moved to
; the opposite edge; counted down once per pass by #R$6821. While it is non-zero Horace is invisible and frozen: #R$624F
; reads no keys, #R$6337 does not plan him, #R$65A1 scores nothing and #R$6821 only copies the next position to the
; current one. Cleared by #R$673A when he dies; otherwise 0.
;
@label=WrapPause
g$7C79 DEFB $00
